      "source": {
        "kind": "cited",
        "ref": "Landmark: at L = theta (with x0 = 0) the Weibull survival probability is R = e^-1 = 0.36788 for ANY shape b, because (L/theta)^b = 1. Not re-read; standard Weibull result."
